1
00:00:02,640 --> 00:00:06,340
Together, the friends had managed to seize
the amulet

2
00:00:06,420 --> 00:00:09,840
and destroy its spell over Cyra and the
gods.

3
00:00:10,720 --> 00:00:13,180
Loki's deceitful plan had been foiled,

4
00:00:13,340 --> 00:00:17,080
and his false play had been ended once and
for all.

5
00:00:17,920 --> 00:00:21,140
The sinister power of the amulet should
never again

6
00:00:21,140 --> 00:00:24,520
do any damage to humans or to the gods.

7
00:00:25,000 --> 00:00:28,300
Such was the vow the friends took that
day.
